// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`the local UI approval source (M1-11a) > says what a proof makes public on a send that adds proof (11 §5.6, D-109) 1`] = `"Your rules ask you to approve every proof. A proof is public. Anyone can see that your agent recorded something, when, and what kind it was (a message, a file, an offer). They can't see what it says. If Someone who is not in your contacts yet confirms delivery, it also becomes public that it went to their agent."`;
